{
  "uid": "argocd-applications",
  "title": "Argo CD - Applications",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "project",
        "label": "Project",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "mimir"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(argocd_app_info, project)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(argocd_app_info, project)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "application",
        "label": "Application",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "mimir"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(argocd_app_info{project=~\"$project\"}, name)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(argocd_app_info{project=~\"$project\"}, name)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Argo CD - Applications\nSync and health of every Argo CD Application, and the controllers behind them. An app stays **OutOfSync** when its live state differs from Git and nothing syncs it: the **Auto-sync** column shows which apps have auto-sync off, and **Auto-sync overridden** lists the ones switched in the Argo CD UI against their `argo.yaml`. Failed syncs and git failures point at the cause; slow reconciles and requests waiting on the repository lock mean the repo server is the bottleneck. Pick a project and an application, or **All**; the reconcile, repo server and ApplicationSet panels cover the whole instance."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Applications",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "count(argocd_app_info{project=~\"$project\", name=~\"$application\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
